<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 01:24:26 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>一种常见的甜味剂可能会破坏大脑的保护屏障，从而增加中风的风险</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/one-common-sweetener-may-increase-stroke-risk-by-damaging-the-brains-protective-barrier</link><description>血脑屏障围绕着穿过大脑的血管，允许氧气和营养物质进入，同时阻止毒素和病原体进入。这绝对是一个&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/one-common-sweetener-may-increase-stroke-risk-by-damaging-the-brains-protective-barrier.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 01:24:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/one-common-sweetener-may-increase-stroke-risk-by-damaging-the-brains-protective-barrier</guid></item><item><title>儿科高级别胶质瘤的疫苗治疗：现状、挑战和未来方向</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/vaccine-therapy-for-pediatric-highgrade-glioma-current-landscape-challenges-and-future-directions-neurooncology</link><description>儿童高级别胶质瘤 (pHGG) 是最具侵袭性的儿童脑肿瘤之一，治疗选择有限且预后不良。基于疫苗的免疫疗法提供了一种有前途的策略，它利用肿瘤特异性或相关抗原以最小的毒性刺激持久的抗肿瘤免疫反应。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/vaccine-therapy-for-pediatric-highgrade-glioma-current-landscape-challenges-and-future-directions-neurooncology.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 01:09:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/vaccine-therapy-for-pediatric-highgrade-glioma-current-landscape-challenges-and-future-directions-neurooncology</guid></item><item><title>燃气轮机准备好迎接氢经济了吗？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/are-gas-turbines-ready-for-the-hydrogen-economy</link><description>我们能否用氢气代替化石燃料为燃气轮机提供燃料，从而将全球二氧化碳 (CO2) 减少 15%？&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/are-gas-turbines-ready-for-the-hydrogen-economy.jpg" /&gt; 由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:54:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/are-gas-turbines-ready-for-the-hydrogen-economy</guid></item><item><title>牛的内心世界塑造地球大气的新方式</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/a-new-way-that-a-cows-inner-world-shapes-earths-atmosphere</link><description>在牛肠道微生物内发现的细胞器有助于解释牲畜打嗝如何导致地球变暖。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-new-way-that-a-cows-inner-world-shapes-earths-atmosphere.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:39:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/a-new-way-that-a-cows-inner-world-shapes-earths-atmosphere</guid></item><item><title>马来西亚的资源焦虑考验亚洲最快的数据中心建设</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/malaysias-resource-anxiety-tests-asias-fastest-data-center-build-out</link><description>香港/马来西亚柔佛州——在超越新加坡成为该地区增长最快的数据中心中心之后，随着使该行业增长复杂化的资源争论蔓延到新兴亚洲，马来西亚正面临着更严格的审查。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/malaysias-resource-anxiety-tests-asias-fastest-data-center-build-out.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:24:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/malaysias-resource-anxiety-tests-asias-fastest-data-center-build-out</guid></item><item><title>2026 年世界幸福报告：社交媒体与幸福的复杂全球图景</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/world-happiness-report-2026-complex-global-picture-of-social-media-and-happiness</link><description>盖洛普世界民意调查数据显示，在过去十年中，美国、加拿大、澳大利亚和新西兰 25 岁以下年轻人的生活评价大幅下降（在 0-10 分制中几乎下降了 1 分），而世界其他地区年轻人的平均生活评价则有所上升。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/world-happiness-report-2026-complex-global-picture-of-social-media-and-happiness2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:09:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/world-happiness-report-2026-complex-global-picture-of-social-media-and-happiness</guid></item><item><title>Moonshotai/KimiK3·抱脸</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/moonshotai-kimik3-%c2%b7-hugging-face</link><description>除了 Kimi K3 之外，我们还开放了其背后的更多堆栈——高性能注意力内核、MoE 通信库以及用于大规模运行代理环境的基础设施。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/moonshotai-kimik3-c2b7-hugging-face.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 23:54:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/moonshotai-kimik3-%c2%b7-hugging-face</guid></item><item><title>雀形目鸟类鸣叫的全球生物地理学</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/the-global-biogeography-of-passerine-songs</link><description>尽管鸟鸣声是理解声音交流进化的经典模型，但它们的全球多样性长期以来使得统一框架的开发充满挑战。通过分析全球 3,000 多种雀形目鸟类歌曲的声学结构，我们表明该声学空间可以围绕八个基本主题构建。这些主题的不同使用是由物种的生物特征（社会组织、形态和交配系统）和声音传播物理学的结合驱动的。在热带雨林中，传输效率的环境过滤有利于结构简单的图案，例如平口哨。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-global-biogeography-of-passerine-songs2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 23:39:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/the-global-biogeography-of-passerine-songs</guid></item><item><title>合成肿瘤数据帮助人工智能改进长读癌症突变检测</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/synthetic-tumor-data-helps-ai-improve-long-read-cancer-mutation-detection</link><description>香港大学 (HKU) 的一个研究团队开发了 ClairS——一种深度学习算法，可显着改进使用长读长测序对癌症突变的检测。 ClairS 在乳腺癌、肺癌和黑色素瘤细胞系数据集上进行了测试，证明了在各种癌症类型和测序条件下的高精度。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/synthetic-tumor-data-helps-ai-improve-long-read-cancer-mutation-detection2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 23:24:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/synthetic-tumor-data-helps-ai-improve-long-read-cancer-mutation-detection</guid></item><item><title>科学家称，一种无形的力量可以帮助你的意识“适应”周围的世界</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/an-invisible-force-helps-your-consciousness-tune-into-the-world-around-you-scientists-say</link><description>这可能就是为什么你会立即与新朋友“一拍即合”。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/an-invisible-force-helps-your-consciousness-tune-into-the-world-around-you-scientists-say.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 23:09:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/an-invisible-force-helps-your-consciousness-tune-into-the-world-around-you-scientists-say</guid></item></channel></rss>